CELL 8 9 pipe SN 3 E 1 0.00
CELL 8 10 drop N 3 S 1 100.00
BUCKET 119.00 686.00 170.00 120.00
ON 2
LABEL 250.00 250.00 TIMERS & COUNTER\nT1 (flasher) pulses the slide gate:\none batch of sand per pulse.\nPE1 sees each batch, CNT1 counts them.\nAt 5, CNT1 stops T1 and lights H1.\nHold SB1 to reset the count.
